  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`ll.RegionSayTo(TargetID: uuid, Channel: number, Text: string)`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`llRegionSayTo(key TargetID, integer Channel, string Text);`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Says<a href="#cite_note-send-1" target="_blank">&#91;1&#93;</a> the text supplied in string <b>msg</b> on channel supplied in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Integer" target="_blank">integer</a> <b>channel</b> to the <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Object" target="_blank">object</a> or <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Avatar" target="_blank">avatar</a> specified by <b>target</b></p>
</p>
